{"id":56413,"ord":155,"n_segments":182,"prev":56412,"next":56414,"doc":{"id":"68113","title":"68113_Barney Bigard oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Albany Leon \"Barney\" Bigard","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68113/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68113"},"chapter":"Recording career in the 1940s-70s","title":"Recording in France and England; the later session with Claude Luter","category":"recording_session","summary":"Bigard has been to France several times and recorded in France and England only with Louie and Duke until Mrs. Bigard recalls a later record with Claude Luter around 1960.","period":"1959-60","year_from":1959,"year_to":1959,"words":92,"start":[177,3],"end":[178,5],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68113#s56413","tags":{"places":[{"name":"France","focus":1,"type":"country"},{"name":"England","focus":1,"type":"country"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Claude Luter","qid":"Q1096905","n":3},{"name":"Duke Ellington","qid":"Q4030","n":1},{"name":"Louis Armstrong","qid":"Q1779","n":1},{"name":"Frenchman","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"D.B.","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":39,"theme_name":"Going abroad: American jazz musicians touring and living in Europe","community":79,"community_name":"Going abroad: touring Europe and Japan","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":177,"b":3,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"You went to France the same trip, did you not?"},{"p":177,"b":4,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Yeah. Well, I've been to France several times. Been to England twice, I think."},{"p":177,"b":5,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"You recorded in France, haven't you?"},{"p":177,"b":6,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Oh, yeah, several times."},{"p":177,"b":7,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"With whom?"},{"p":177,"b":8,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"With whom? I've recorded with Louie, with Duke -- and recorded in England with Duke. I never recorded with no Frenchman."},{"p":177,"b":9,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"You didn't?"},{"p":177,"b":10,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"No."},{"p":177,"b":11,"s":"MRS. BIGARD","x":"What about Claude Loutierra in later years?"},{"p":177,"b":12,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Oh, Claude Loutierre. That's later."},{"p":178,"b":0,"s":"MS. WILLARD","x":"When was that?"},{"p":178,"b":1,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Oh, --"},{"p":178,"b":2,"s":"VOICE","x":"'60 (inaudible). [December] - D.B."},{"p":178,"b":3,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"'60, huh?"},{"p":178,"b":4,"s":"VOICE","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":178,"b":5,"s":"MR. BIGARD","x":"Yeah, Claude Loutiere. Later That was --"}]}